guarantee isAsciiDecimalDigitCode "Total over the CSignedInt32 domain."
label startIsAsciiDecimalDigitCode
call detectBelowDigitRangeCall math.lessThanI64
argument detectBelowDigitRangeCall left I64 characterCode
argument detectBelowDigitRangeCall right I64 asciiDigitZeroCode
run detectBelowDigitRangeCall
bind value belowDigitRange Bool detectBelowDigitRangeCall
branch if condition belowDigitRange target returnNotDigit
call detectAboveDigitRangeCall math.greaterThanI64
